  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Cyber Security in Samoa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The investment supported the Samoan Government to establish its cyber incident response capability, the Samoa Computer Emergency Response Team (SamCERT) within the Ministry of Communications and Information Technology. Funding under this investment covered operational costs for at least the first 3 years of SamCERT&apos;s operation, as well as training and capacity building to be provided by a cyber security company contracted through the Pacific Cyber Cooperation Program.</narrative>
  </description>
